      "description": "Thriving Bluff entered and o3 Memoir timed out on the color choice, likely defaulting to a non-green color. In a R/G deck with multiple green spells (Affectionate Indrik, Garruk's Uprising, Primeval Herald, Rampaging Growth, Turntimber Basilisk), having Thriving Bluff produce the wrong second color means this land cannot fix for green, which is the entire reason to play it.",
