    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Passed the turn with 3 untapped mana and Thrill of Possibility available. With 3 redundant Mountains in hand as easy discard fodder, Thrill would convert a useless card into 2 fresh draws — pure card advantage. Blindblast as a cantrip was also available. Instead, all 3 mana went unused.",
