      "description": "Declined Turntimber Basilisk's landfall trigger that would force Chandra's Pyreling to block. The Basilisk has deathtouch, so forcing the block would guarantee killing the 1/3 Pyreling (a dangerous threat that snowballs with noncombat damage). Instead, declining means the opponent can freely choose not to block, keeping their Pyreling alive.",
