    {
      "severity": "moderate",
      "description": "Traded Primeval Herald (a repeatable land-fetching engine that would also deal 3 trampling damage on attacks) for Chandra's Pyreling (a 1/3). At 20 life, taking 1 damage is negligible. The Herald would have attacked next turn to fetch another land and pressure the opponent, while Affectionate Indrik (already castable next turn with 6 forests) could fight and kill the Pyreling cleanly.",
