      "better_line": "Don't block. Take 1 damage (going to 19), preserve Primeval Herald to attack next turn (fetching another land and dealing 3 trample damage), and use Affectionate Indrik's fight trigger next turn to cleanly remove Chandra's Pyreling.",
      "type": "blunder",
